            "value": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center;\">Download Files Easily with ArahCloud<\/h2><p>ArahCloud makes it simple to access and download files shared by users. Open the file page, review the available file information, and download your file when it is ready.<\/p><p>Whether you are downloading a document, image, video, software, archive, or other supported file, ArahCloud provides a convenient way to access shared files from any device.<\/p><h3>Safe &amp; Convenient File Sharing<\/h3><p>ArahCloud is designed to make file sharing easy while maintaining a reliable and secure environment for users. Files are provided by their respective uploaders, and availability may depend on the owner's settings and our platform policies.<\/p><p>If you believe a file violates our policies or infringes your rights, you can report it using the available reporting options.<\/p><h3>Need to Share Your Own Files?<\/h3><p>You can also use ArahCloud to upload and share your own files. Store your content online, organize your files, and share them with others using a simple link.<\/p><p><strong>Upload. Store. Share. Download. \u2014 ArahCloud<\/strong><\/p>",
